<title>USA: Scudder offers funds through Merrill, Waterhouse.</title>
<headline>Scudder offers funds through Merrill, Waterhouse.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scudder, Stevens &amp; Clark Inc said it will offer its family of 37 mutual funds through Merrill Lynch and Co Inc and Waterhouse Securities Fund Connection.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch offers mutual funds to a network of more than 14,000 financial consultants nationwide. Waterhouse Securities, a unit of Toronto-Dominion Bank, offers more than 750 no-transaction fee funds from 96 fund groups.</p>
<p>((Boston bureau, (617) 367-4106))</p>
